<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{CURRY OF LIFE SHOP</b></font>

50
00:02:23,530 --> 00:02:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two...
One, two...</font>

51
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:35,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hope they're all right.</font>

52
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure they'll be able
to bring Karashi back.</font>

53
00:02:41,930 --> 00:02:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Definitely, definitely.</font>

54
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two...</font>

55
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Katabami Gold Mine...</font>

56
00:02:57,940 --> 00:03:01,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead of just getting
Rokusuke and Karashi back</font>

57
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">let's finish the Kurosuki Family
once and for all!</font>

58
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get carried away, Naruto.</font>

59
00:03:07,290 --> 00:03:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what are we gonna do then?</font>

60
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm kind of worried about
what Guy-sensei told us.</font>

61
00:03:13,330 --> 00:03:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The boss of the Kurosuki Family
may be</font>

62
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:18,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one of the Seven Ninja
Swordsmen of the Mist.</font>

63
00:03:18,210 --> 00:03:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows what
they'll do to Rokusuke?</font>

64
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, but how seriously
can we take Guy-sensei's info?</font>

65
00:03:25,930 --> 00:03:29,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?!
Guy-sensei is always right!</font>

66
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Lee.
We should investigate first.</font>

67
00:03:32,770 --> 00:03:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

68
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sir Raiga, we were able
to capture Rokusuke,</font>

69
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one of the three that
slipped out of the village.</font>

70
00:04:05,050 --> 00:04:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done.</font>

71
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that they went to ask
for some help from a Ninja village.</font>

72
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:18,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did you go?!</font>

73
00:04:19,030 --> 00:04:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

74
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't bother rookie.</font>

75
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes sir!</font>

76
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rokusuke, I thought we had
a good relationship</font>

77
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with everybody in the Gold Mine.</font>

78
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well that's...</font>

79
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:42,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it? I'm so deeply sorry
to hear that you left the village.</font>

80
00:04:43,590 --> 00:04:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't remember how things
were in the past</font>

81
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when everything was going well.</font>

82
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
I won't do it again!</font>

83
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I have a good idea.</font>

84
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to arrange
for your funeral.</font>

85
00:04:58,230 --> 00:05:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't! Please let me go!</font>

86
00:05:01,650 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't do it again
so please forgive me!</font>

87
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:08,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Don't you like funerals?</font>

88
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I don't wanna die yet!</font>

89
00:05:12,370 --> 00:05:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know I really like funerals...</font>

90
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think about it.</font>

91
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:22,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When they are alive humans speak ill
of each other,</font>

92
00:05:22,630 --> 00:05:25,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they betray each other,
and they hate each other.</font>

93
00:05:25,550 --> 00:05:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But at a funeral,</font>

94
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they forget all the hatred
they had for the other.</font>

95
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:36,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They even remember
the good times they had together.</font>

96
00:05:37,150 --> 00:05:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?</font>

97
00:05:38,650 --> 00:05:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to be kidding me!
No! Please don't do it.</font>

98
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

99
00:05:44,530 --> 00:05:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me go!</font>

100
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a done deal then.
Let's have a big funeral for Rokusuke.</font>

101
00:05:49,990 --> 00:05:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah!
— Yeah!</font>

102
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on!</font>

103
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up!</font>

104
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that gold?
There's nothing shiny about it.</font>

105
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have to melt
that ore into mercury.</font>

106
00:06:32,330 --> 00:06:36,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that they evaporate it
and only then does it turn into pure gold.</font>

107
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't get it.</font>

108
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well there is no need
for you to understand it.</font>

109
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

110
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What are you doing?!
Hurry up!</font>

111
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't hurry up</font>

112
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna ask the boss
to let me hold your funeral!</font>

113
00:06:59,690 --> 00:07:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive me!</font>

114
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:06,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm getting really mad now.
I won't forgive them!</font>

115
00:07:06,610 --> 00:07:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Naruto...</font>

116
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know anything
about them yet.</font>

117
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. We should do
what Neji is telling us.</font>

118
00:07:14,030 --> 00:07:15,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah but...</font>

119
00:07:15,450 --> 00:07:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we don't do something
that poor old guy is going to die!</font>

120
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, leave things to me here.</font>

121
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Lee!</font>

122
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey.
Hurry up and pick them up!</font>

123
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Way to go Lee!</font>

124
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay old man?</font>

125
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:51,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my gosh!
What have you done?!</font>

126
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here. Drink some water.</font>

127
00:07:56,370 --> 00:07:57,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

128
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you.
Please punch me, kick me.</font>

129
00:08:01,210 --> 00:08:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please knock me around</font>

130
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like the way you just did
with those guys.</font>

131
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:05,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

132
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you won't do it
I'll do it myself!</font>

133
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:11,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

134
00:08:11,550 --> 00:08:12,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

135
00:08:12,930 --> 00:08:14,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm scared.</font>

136
00:08:14,590 --> 00:08:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just think what they'll do</font>

137
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if they knew I was
the only one that was safe.</font>

138
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that sound?</font>

139
00:08:29,230 --> 00:08:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did they find us?</font>

140
00:08:31,150 --> 00:08:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, that's the sound
of the funeral bell.</font>

141
00:08:35,570 --> 00:08:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Funeral?</font>

142
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

143
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga, the boss of the Kurosuki family
which rules this town</font>

144
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">arranges a funeral for
those who betray him.</font>

145
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He buries them alive.</font>

146
00:08:47,170 --> 00:08:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? They bury them alive?
That's so cruel!</font>

147
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah but...</font>

148
00:08:53,590 --> 00:08:58,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga always cries sadly
during the funeral.</font>

149
00:08:58,470 --> 00:09:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's one weird guy.</font>

150
00:09:01,470 --> 00:09:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

151
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:06,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't seem to be
the sound of the bell for you.</font>

152
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I heard that Rokusuke
was caught this morning so...</font>

153
00:09:11,650 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

154
00:09:47,730 --> 00:09:53,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm so happy I remember
the first day I met that guy.</font>

155
00:09:54,110 --> 00:09:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah? That's nice.</font>

156
00:09:57,110 --> 00:10:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... When I told him we were taking
over the mountain from the magistrate</font>

157
00:10:03,620 --> 00:10:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was so relieved to be freed from
the high taxes that he was paying.</font>

158
00:10:09,330 --> 00:10:16,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was laughing out of pure joy...
He was a really nice guy.</font>

159
00:10:18,050 --> 00:10:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like funerals.
Makes me feel nostalgic.</font>

160
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:25,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would you put on
a big funeral for me too?</font>

161
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:28,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! I'm not putting on
a funeral for you.</font>

162
00:10:29,230 --> 00:10:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are not going
to die before me.</font>

163
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have to have a funeral for you
to think of the good times</font>

164
00:10:35,190 --> 00:10:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because you are always a good boy.</font>

165
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga.</font>

166
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

167
00:10:45,290 --> 00:10:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're coming.
They'll show up anytime now.</font>

168
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:54,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I'm excited to see
what kind of help he sought.</font>

169
00:10:57,260 --> 00:11:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's save the guy.</font>

170
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:02,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's do it, Neji.</font>

171
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

172
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

173
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right. He's still alive.</font>

174
00:11:18,190 --> 00:11:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we can get rid of
the guys around him</font>

175
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:21,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can save him.</font>

176
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Let's get rid
of them quickly!</font>

177
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

178
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go!</font>

179
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...! Let me out!</font>

180
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An enemy attack!</font>

181
00:12:09,370 --> 00:12:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

182
00:12:10,830 --> 00:12:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten, you take the right!</font>

183
00:12:13,330 --> 00:12:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

184
00:12:27,050 --> 00:12:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

185
00:12:34,690 --> 00:12:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

186
00:12:40,530 --> 00:12:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Zu-Ma-Ki...</font>

187
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barrage!</font>

188
00:12:54,250 --> 00:12:56,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the way!</font>

189
00:12:56,710 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Watch out!
— Huh?</font>

190
00:12:58,210 --> 00:12:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are three more!</font>

191
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here comes the Leaf Village's
Handsome Devil Rock Lee!</font>

192
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found the last one!</font>

193
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:21,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...</font>

194
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is this guy?</font>

195
00:13:23,860 --> 00:13:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

196
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Karashi.</font>

197
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one Grandma Sansho
was talking about...</font>

198
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:33,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Karashi?</font>

199
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:39,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, was it your own decision
to join the Kurosuki Family...</font>

200
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:42,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just like Grandma Sansho said it was?</font>

201
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what if it was?</font>

202
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

203
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sir Raiga is great!</font>

204
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:51,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He dethroned the old evil government
of the Katabami Gold Mine</font>

205
00:13:51,810 --> 00:13:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he liberated everybody
from the village!</font>

206
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two, one, two...</font>

207
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two, one, two...</font>

208
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm, Grandma...</font>

209
00:14:06,990 --> 00:14:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my...
You are so greedy!</font>

210
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are fighting their lives
out there by going into the gold mine...</font>

211
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:17,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't you just wait at least
while I'm cooking the curry?</font>

212
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mind waiting but...
I think something is burning.</font>

213
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

214
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, oh my...</font>

215
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oops...</font>

216
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, it burned...</font>

217
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, did you know that</font>

218
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:39,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho worries about you
everyday while cooking curry?</font>

219
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, leave things to me here.</font>

220
00:14:44,530 --> 00:14:49,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, you saved my life
with your curry of life.</font>

221
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:53,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can make such
a wonderful curry,</font>

222
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:56,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how can you stay with the family of
a man with no respect for life?!</font>

223
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

224
00:14:59,160 --> 00:15:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody cares to compliment me
even if I can make that curry.</font>

225
00:15:03,340 --> 00:15:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a man born in this world</font>

226
00:15:05,630 --> 00:15:08,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should gain more power and
try to take over the world!</font>

227
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead of sitting around in that store
that no one patronizes anymore.</font>

228
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:16,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? I can't take this anymore!</font>

229
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:25,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

230
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:33,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, not only did you and
Grandma Sansho's curry save my life...</font>

231
00:15:34,660 --> 00:15:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you also taught me that
if you make it from the heart</font>

232
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just one serving of curry
could save lives</font>

233
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:46,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and that even somebody like me
could do anything just by trying hard.</font>

234
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You looked much stronger
and dignified then than you do now.</font>

235
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi!</font>

236
00:16:11,650 --> 00:16:14,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen anybody
who tries this hard.</font>

237
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. You want to save
this boy too, huh...</font>

238
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please promise me...
Please get out of the Kurosuki Family!</font>

239
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right...</font>

240
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... I'm so sorry!</font>

241
00:16:47,770 --> 00:16:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I'm so relieved.</font>

242
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:53,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Please get me out of here.</font>

243
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dark and I can't breathe.</font>

244
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah!</font>

245
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:00,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We almost forgot
about Rokusuke.</font>

246
00:17:06,210 --> 00:17:08,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mmm? You guys...</font>

247
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to keep you waiting.
It's all right now.</font>

248
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. Thinking that maybe</font>

249
00:17:14,930 --> 00:17:17,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could still save my friend
who got buried alive...</font>

250
00:17:17,300 --> 00:17:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just couldn't stay still.</font>

251
00:17:20,260 --> 00:17:22,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I understand.</font>

252
00:17:25,690 --> 00:17:27,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, what is it?</font>

253
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

254
00:17:40,990 --> 00:17:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This feeling of danger...</font>

255
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey Neji, what is it?</font>

256
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are being watched.
It's probably Raiga.</font>

257
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:53,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

258
00:17:54,170 --> 00:17:55,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the top of that cliff...</font>

259
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Let's go!</font>

260
00:17:58,300 --> 00:18:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, please take care of Rokusuke.</font>

261
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

262
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one's here.</font>

263
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did he go?</font>

264
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mmm? What is that?</font>

265
00:18:26,410 --> 00:18:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mist...</font>

266
00:18:33,170 --> 00:18:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Hidden Mist Jutsu!</font>

267
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:43,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Mist Jutsu...
A specialty of Mist Village Ninja.</font>

268
00:18:43,220 --> 00:18:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what Guy-sensei said was true?</font>

269
00:18:46,730 --> 00:18:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, I can't see anything!</font>

270
00:18:49,850 --> 00:18:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, try to find the enemy
with your Byakugan.</font>

271
00:18:52,690 --> 00:18:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been trying...!</font>

272
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:05,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... Can't see a thing!</font>

273
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible.
Even Neji's Byakugan</font>

274
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:12,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's supposed to let him
see 360 degrees won't work!</font>

275
00:19:13,710 --> 00:19:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

276
00:19:15,460 --> 00:19:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There isn't supposed to be
a Jutsu that can break Byakugan!</font>

277
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:35,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think, Ranmaru?</font>

278
00:19:36,650 --> 00:19:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's amazing...</font>

279
00:19:37,990 --> 00:19:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of them can see through
the Chakra Network.</font>

280
00:19:42,700 --> 00:19:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He probably has some sort
of Kekkei Genkai power.</font>

281
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can see us?</font>

282
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right
my power is superior to his...</font>

283
00:19:52,750 --> 00:19:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what are you going to do?</font>

284
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody in the Katabami
Gold Mine is depending on me.</font>

285
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one who has to
keep the peace of this village.</font>

286
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to hold a funeral?</font>

287
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No even if I hold a funeral
I have no memories of them.</font>

288
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll just get rid of them!</font>

289
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look
Ninja Art: Lightning Fang!</font>

290
00:20:32,330 --> 00:20:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What is it?!</font>

291
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning! Drop!</font>

292
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think, Ranmaru?</font>

293
00:20:53,980 --> 00:20:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's great, Raiga!</font>

294
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:22,210
